  "hints": [
    "Each item can be picked AT MOST once (0 or 1 times).",
    "In 1D DP `dp[0..capacity]`, iterate capacity BACKWARD `for cap in range(capacity, w - 1, -1)` per item so item i is never reused multiple times in the same row!",
    "Pseudocode:\n  dp = [0] * (capacity + 1)\n  for w, v in zip(weights, values):\n      for cap in range(capacity, w - 1, -1):\n          dp[cap] = max(dp[cap], dp[cap - w] + v)\n  return dp[capacity]"
